# Styling Guide

This project uses [Tailwind CSS v4](https://tailwindcss.com) (via `@tailwindcss/vite`). All theme tokens live in [app.css](mdc:src/app.css). Style components with utility classes in markup; avoid `<style>` blocks unless something can't be expressed with utilities (e.g. `{@html}` content).

## Theme colors

Semantic colors follow the light/dark theme switch automatically. Each token is defined once in `app.css` as `light-dark(<light>, <dark>)`; the theme switch only sets `color-scheme` on `<html>`.

| Utility suffix | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `fg-1`, `fg-2` | primary / secondary text |
| `surface-1` … `surface-4` | backgrounds, from base to most raised |
| `brand`, `brand-fg` | brand color and text on it |
| `link`, `accent` | links and highlights |
| `star`, `planet`, `nebula` | space decorations |

```svelte
<div class="rounded-md border border-surface-3 bg-surface-2 p-5 text-fg-1">
	<a class="text-link hover:text-accent">Link</a>
	<span class="bg-brand/15">Translucent brand tint</span>
</div>
```

## Design rules

Keep the design predictable: pick from these values instead of inventing new ones.

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Spacing | `1`, `2`, `5`, `12` steps only. Sections `gap-12`, cards/grids `gap-5`, chips `gap-2`. |
| Radius | Controls (buttons, badges, inputs, nav items) `rounded-md`. Containers (cards, banners, tiles) `rounded-2xl`. |
| Borders | Dividers and page chrome `border-brand/20`. Boxes `border-surface-3`. |
| Brand tint | Hover `bg-brand/15`, active/selected `bg-brand/30`. |
| Glow | `color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand or --accent) N%, transparent)`, never hard-coded rgba. |
| Meta text | `text-xs text-fg-2`. |

Boxes with a background use `Card`, not ad-hoc `bg-surface-2 p-5` divs.

## Breakpoints

`xs` 360px, `sm` 480px, `md` 768px, `lg` 1024px, `xl` 1440px, `2xl` 1920px. Write mobile-first (`md:grid-cols-2`) or use `max-*` for "below" (`max-md:hidden`).

## Typography

- `.space-title`, `.space-subtitle`, `.space-heading` — page-level headings (responsive). Pages start with `PageHeader`.
- `.space-hero` + `.space-tagline` — gradient headline and accent pill for hero sections (home, error).
- `.prose` — wrapper for rendered markdown.

## Components

- Variant components (`Button`, `Badge`, `Link`, `Card`) use `cva` with Tailwind classes; merge consumer classes with `cn()` from `$lib/utils` so overrides win.
- Wrap pages in `OneColumnLayout`.
- `BackBar` for "← Back to …" bars; `.card-grid` for responsive card grids; `.icon-bubble` for round emoji/icon holders.
- Custom animations: `animate-twinkle`, `animate-ring-pulse`, `animate-placeholder-pulse` (set `[--pulse-min:…] [--pulse-max:…]`), `animate-gradient-shift`.
